set general.templates Modeles
open Rendu/Tout le Markdown.md
bottom tasks
wait 400
shot vault-tasks-before
task 1
wait 600
shot vault-task-checked
bottom broken
wait 400
shot vault-broken-before
create-broken 1
wait 600
shot vault-broken-created
set files.hide_templates false
bottom tasks
wait 400
shot vault-tasks-with-templates
quit
